t-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The online application for this recruitment has start from <strong>31 </strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">May 2025</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the last date for online application for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer</strong></span><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The last date for online application Form is <strong>15 June 2025</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What is the age limit for <strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer</strong><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2025</strong>?</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2025</strong></span>\u00a0is as follows:</span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\">The minimum age is <strong>21</strong> and the maximum age is <strong>47 years as on 01 August 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>Vacancy 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:\u00a0 </strong></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a relevant degree\u2014B.A.M.S. for Ayurvedic, B.H.M.S. for Homeopathic, and B.U.M.S. for Unani\u2014from a recognized university approved by the respective Central Councils. They must have completed a compulsory rotatory internship and be registered with the appropriate Bihar State Medical Council based on their discipline.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>Bihar SHSB </b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <b>Bihar SHSB </b>is https://shs.bihar.gov.in/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-18803 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SHS-Bihar-Ayush-Doctor-Vacancy-1024x576-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SHS-Bihar-Ayush-Doctor-Vacancy-1024x576-1.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/SHS-Bihar-Ayu